 goal? And will Shindou manage to become an intermediary between Japan and the Anisotorons...?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.8}],"value":6.8,"age":"N/A"},"current_season_id":10578,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}